\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In 'Oddball' (2015), a Maremma dog guards which birds on Middle Island near Warrnambool?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Penguins\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"On ABC's Play School, which began in 1966, children look through the round window, the square window and which third window?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Arched window\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"round\": 4,\n      \"genre\": \"geography\",\n      \"difficulty\": 2,\n      \"region\": \"au\",\n      \"count\": 4,\n      \"correct_rate\": 0.6,\n      \"questions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which Queensland island near Brisbane is the world's second largest sand island?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Moreton Island\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Cocos (Keeling) Islands lie in which ocean?\",\n          \"options\": [\n            \"Southern\",\n            \"Atlantic\",\n            \"Pacific\",\n            \"Indian\"\n          ],\n          \"answer\": \"Indian\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which city is the capital of Australia's state with Rottnest-free Gold Coast? Gold Coast's nearest capital.\",\n          \"answer\": \"Brisbane\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which Victorian national park is mainland Australia's southernmost point?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Wilsons Promontory\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"round\": 5,\n      \"genre\": \"music\",\n      \"difficulty\": 2,\n      \"region\": \"au\",\n      \"count\": 4,\n      \"correct_rate\": 0.85,\n      \"questions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Spiderbait's cover of Lead Belly's 'Black Betty' (2004) is sung by the band's drummer, known as what?\",\n          \"options\": [\n            \"Bubs\",\n            \"Whitey\",\n            \"Kram\",\n            \"Janet\"\n          ],\n          \"answer\": \"Kram\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which Tamworth music event is held each January?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Tamworth Country Music Festival\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Skyhooks' 1975 album 'Living in the 70's' — which city's suburbs did their song 'Carlton (Lygon Street Limbo)' name-check?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Melbourne\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Which instrument, a long wooden Aboriginal wind instrument, features on many Yothu Yindi recordings?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Didgeridoo\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"round\": 6,\n      \"genre\": \"film\",\n      \"difficulty\": 3,\n      \"region\": \"au\",\n      \"count\": 4,\n      \"correct_rate\": 0.65,\n      \"questions\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Netflix's 'Boy Swallows Universe' (2024) is set in which city's suburbs?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Brisbane\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"The ABC comedy 'Utopia' is set in which fictional government agency?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Nation Building Authority\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"In 'The Babadook' (2014), what is the Babadook's first name, Mister ___?\",\n          \"answer\": \"Mister Babadook\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Bruce Beresford's 1976 film 'Don's Party' takes place on the night of which event?\",\n          \"options\": [\n            \"The 1975 Dismissal\",\n            \"Australia Day 1970\",\n            \"The 1972 Melbourne Cup\",\n            \"The 1969 federal election\"\n          ],\n          \"answer\": \"The 1969 federal election\",\n          \"marks\": [\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Quizzly Bears\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Les Quizerables\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"Opera House Party\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": true\n            },\n            {\n              \"team\": \"The Blow-Ins\",\n              \"answer\": \"\",\n              \"correct\": false\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"# Venue notes (Sydney, Australia)\\n\\n- Country: Australia. Use region `au` (or global).\\n- Format: 6 rounds of 4 has now been asked for two nights running, but both times as a request for tonight only. Default is still 5 rounds of 8 unless told otherwise.\\n- The crowd loves film (the trivia master said so). Keep about 3 rounds in 5 on film. Film at difficulty 3 gets about 50-65% right, which is slightly hard but acceptable. At 2 it gets about 75%.\\n- Music at difficulty 2 went very well (about 85%), so music can be tried at 3 next time. Science and geography at 2 got about 60%, so keep them at 2.\\n- Difficulty: start next night at 2 for non-film rounds and film at 2 or 3, then move by the usual rules.\\n- The bank records answers as served, and no answer sheet came back. Use round_summary after each round.\\n- Still to try: history again at 2 (it was hard at 3), and sport.\\n- The bank sometimes serves a garbled question (e.g. a geography one). Flag it to the room when that happens.\\n\"\n}\n"
          },
