\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"points\\\":13}]}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01JfLDSFT2ykjZfHgnUau2TU\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes\\n- Country: Australia (Sydney). Use region `au`.\\n- Start next night at difficulty 2. Difficulty 3 gave 55% right (music), while difficulty 2 avera…\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"That's all six rounds done. The notes are saved for next week.\\n\\n**Final standings:**\\n1. Quizzly Bears: 19\\n2. Les Quizerables: 17\\n3. The Blow-Ins: 15\\n4. The Bondi Brainstormers: 14\\n5. Opera House Party: 13\\n\\n**How the crowd did:** the bank marked 67 of the 100 difficulty 2 answers correct, about two in three. Music at difficulty 3 was the toughest round at 55%.\\n\\n**Difficulty:** round 1 (music) started at 3 and scored 55%, so I dropped to 2 for rounds 2 to 6. Rounds 2 and 5 scored exactly 75%, which isn't over 75%, so I held at 2 each time.\\n\\n**Things to know:**\\n- **Week number:** the bank called tonight week 1, even though four teams had played here before.\\n- **No answer sheets:** I had no answer sheets to submit, so all marks come from the bank's round summaries.\\n- **Garbled question:** the third geography question in round 6 had garbled wording. I read it out as written and flagged it.\\n\\n**Notes for next week:** the notes record that the venue is in Australia, that the next night should start at difficulty 2, and which genres did best and worst.\"}"
